TI  - The functional neuroimaging correlates of psychogenic versus organic dystonia.
AU  - Schrag Anette E
AU  - Mehta Arpan R
AU  - Bhatia Kailash P
AU  - Brown Richard J
AU  - Frackowiak Richard S J
AU  - Trimble Michael R
AU  - Ward Nicholas S
